,"kind":"announcement","title":"Launching into Early Access November 16! Play the Steam Next Fest Demo!","summary":"Littlelands Has a Release Date for Early Access!Our little adventure is almost here! 💛Hello, adventurers!We've been hard at work bringing the charming world of Littlelands to life, and today we're thrilled to finally share some exciting news!Littlelands officially launches into Early Access on November 16 on Steam! 🎉From lush forests and mysterious caves to quirky characters and hidden treasures, we can't wait for you to discover everything our little world has to offer.And what better way to ce","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:55:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690071","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2083660-1833334318569993","game_id":"steam-2083660","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Now Live! 🌿 Community Feedback Changes","summary":"🌿 Littlelands Demo Update is Live! Hey all! We’ve been absolutely thrilled by the response to the Littlelands demo so far. Thank you so much for playing, sharing screenshots, reporting bugs, and leaving feedback. 💛 Today we’re rolling out a new demo update featuring several community-requested improvements and fixes! Control Improvements One of the biggest pieces of feedback we received was around the default mouse & keyboard controls, especially keeping important actions closer to the WASD keys","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T19:50:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318569993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2083660-1831432155577346","game_id":"steam-2083660","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now! 🌿 Your Cozy Adventure Begins","summary":"🌿 The Littlelands Demo is Out Now! ✨Your cozy adventure begins today.Step into Littlelands, a charming world filled with big-hearted characters, lush landscapes, and peaceful moments waiting to be discovered. Whether you’re exploring hidden caves, chatting with quirky locals, or simply watching the sunset, Littlelands is yours to enjoy at your own pace.🧭 What’s in the Demo?• ~2 hours of gameplay • Custom character creation • 6 unique areas to explore • 20+ NPCs to meet and help • Multiple shops ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T13:01:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2083660-5746109972561066549","game_id":"steam-2083660","kind":"announcement","title":"A Sneak Peak Into Littlelands","summary":"As premiered on #IGNLive: We hope that you enjoy our sneak peek gameplay overview that we had prepared for #IGNLive. It's beyond cool to have our title featured in 2 Summer Games Fest Showcases. Dive deep into the adorable world of Littlelands, a charming and colorful diorama-style wonderland brimming with secrets. Journey on a once-in-a-lifetime expedition when the simple task of repairing a computer becomes a mysterious adventure across hills, valleys, and caves filled with adventure. Every bi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-06-09T21:31:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5746109972561066549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2083660-5746109972556682281","game_id":"steam-2083660","kind":"announcement","title":"Gettin' Cozy with Wholesome Games Direct","summary":"We were featured in Wholesome Game Direct! Initially, we had planned to share that we were going to launch the game's demo! However, our team wanted to make sure that the demo was absolutely perfect. Please see a note from our developers below: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42978728/27d996916b6b6702b02fd9fd969f5506fa3cd66d.png Today, during the Wholesome Games Direct, we were truly thrilled to announce the launch of a free demo for Littlelands on Steam. After thoughtful discussions between our development ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-06-08T16:39:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5746109972556682281","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2083660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2083660":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2083660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z"},"3015660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:52:28Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2083660","app_id":2083660,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b977124b8b8e464a22efa4cd07ae64de00bbe005b7b43c5ea75e65d3907f5f34","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"The Littlelands region is brimming with strange characters and magical landscapes to discover if you k